.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt SSL_LIBRARY_INIT 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm SSL_library_init ,
.Nm OpenSSL_add_ssl_algorithms
.Nd initialize SSL library by registering algorithms
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/ssl.h
.Ft int
.Fo SSL_library_init
.Fa void
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo OpenSSL_add_ssl_algorithms
.Fa void
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn SSL_library_init
registers the available SSL/TLS ciphers and digests.
.Pp
.Fn OpenSSL_add_ssl_algorithms
is a synonym for
.Fn SSL_library_init
and is implemented as a macro.
.Sh NOTES
.Fn SSL_library_init
must be called before any other action takes place.
.Fn SSL_library_init
is not reentrant.
.Sh WARNINGS
.Fn SSL_library_init
adds ciphers and digests used directly and indirectly by SSL/TLS.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn SSL_library_init
always returns "1", so it is safe to discard the return value.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ssl 7 ,
.Xr RAND_add 3
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Fn SSL_library_init
and
.Fn OpenSSL_add_ssl_algorithms
functions were deprecated in OpenSSL 1.1.0 by
.Xr OPENSSL_init_ssl 3 .
